k","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T21:05:43.666Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"Alphabet宣布拟通过股权融资800亿美元，用于扩展AI基础设施。Anthropic已秘密提交IPO申请，在上市竞赛中领先于竞争对手OpenAI。此外，SpaceX正与华尔街机构协商其IPO的承销费用，HPE则因AI基础设施需求旺盛，年度销售预期超出市场估计。","reportEdition":"2026-06-03","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpwoaoyd04pcslsnnqfm8490","title":"Anthropic扩展Project Glasswing计划","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-06-03T00:00:18.182Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpwoaoyd04pcslsnnqfm8490","https://www.anthropic.com/news/expanding-project-glasswing"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpwoaoyd04pcslsnnqfm8490","title":"Anthropic扩展Project Glasswing计划","originalTitle":"","summary":"Anthropic正将其Project Glasswing计划扩展至约150个新组织，此前首批约50个合作伙伴。新伙伴分布于十五个多国家，覆盖电力、水务、医疗、通信和硬件等关键基础设施行业。这些合作伙伴的共同点在于，其代码库若遭成功攻击，后果可能极其严重，影响或超1亿人。项目旨在利用Claude Mythos Preview等前沿模型扫描漏洞并协助修复，以应对AI驱动的网络安全挑战。同时，Anthropic推出了基于Claude Opus 4.8等公开模型的Claude Security产品，用于扫描代码并建议补丁。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpwoaoyd04pcslsnnqfm8490","originalUrl":"https://www.anthropic.com/news/expanding-project-glasswing","publishedAt":"2026-06-03T00:00:18.182Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-15gzes8","originalSourceName":"Anthropic：Newsroom（网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"official","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpwoaoyd04pcslsnnqfm8490","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T21:05:43.666Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-15gzes8","name":"Anthropic：Newsroom（网页）","s