分那些激活模式相似但因果效应不同的模型特征，团队提出一种新方法。该方法通过分析特征的下游连接来预测其实际影响，并使用基于共激活统计的TWERA（虚拟权重）对连接进行加权排序。实验表明，借助下游连接信息能更准确地判断哪个特征会引导特定输出。此方法为识别模型内部真正的因果组件提供了新途径。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpwgl5go02q3slsnw6pl0fs5","originalUrl":"https://transformer-circuits.pub/2026/may-update/index.html","publishedAt":"2026-06-03T00:00:18.182Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-591jiv","originalSourceName":"Anthropic：Transformer Circuits（可解释性研究）","family":"anthropic","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpwgl5go02q3slsnw6pl0fs5","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T21:05:43.666Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-591jiv","name":"Anthropic：Transformer Circuits（可解释性研究）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T21:05:43.666Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Anthropic可解释性团队介绍了其Circuits研究的新进展。为区分那些激活模式相似但因果效应不同的模型特征，团队提出一种新方法。该方法通过分析特征的下游连接来预测其实际影响，并使用基于共激活统计的TWERA（虚拟权重）对连接进行加权排序。实验表明，借助下游连接信息能更准确地判断哪个特征会引导特定输出。此方法为识别模型内部真正的因果组件提供了新途径。","reportEdition":"2026-06-03","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpwf5ekt02dvslsnxsj6m2rp","title":"Codex正在成为每个人的生产力工具","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-06-03T00:00:18.182Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpwf5ekt02dvslsnxsj6m2rp","https://openai.com/index/codex-for-knowledge-work"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpwf5ekt02dvslsnxsj6m2rp","title":"Codex正在成为每个人的生产力工具","originalTitle":"","summary":"The Next Era of Knowledge Work报告指出，Codex正通过AI增强的研究、数据分析、工作流自动化与内容创作，变革知识工作的生产力。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpwf5ekt02dvslsnxsj6m2rp","originalUrl":"https://openai.com/index/codex-for-knowledge-work","publishedAt":"2026-06-03T00:00:18.182Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1wljf9q","originalSourceName":"OpenAI：官网动态（RSS · 排除企业/客户案例）","family":"openai","kind":"official","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpwf5ekt02dvslsnxsj6m2rp","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T21:05:43.666Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1wljf9q","name":"OpenAI：官网动态（RSS · 排除企业/客户案例）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T21:05:43.666Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"The Next Era of Knowledge Work报告指出，Codex正通过AI增强的研究、数据分析、工作流自动化与内容创作，变革知识工作的生产力。","reportEdition":"2026-06-03","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpw5sd9k00agsl1un4z8njv7","title":"为了不花那120刀，我把电脑清理软件做成了开源skill","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-06-03T00:00:18.182Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpw5sd9k00agsl1un4z8njv7","https://x.com/Khazix0918/status/2061669881725309048"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpw5sd9k00agsl1un4z8njv7","title":"为了不花那120刀，我把电脑清理软件做成了开源skill","originalTitle":"","summary":"作者受一条推文启发，使用Codex对自己的MacBook进行了只读存储分析，发现了B站缓存视频等大量可清理空间（激进方案超140G）。为替代收费软件CleanMyMac，作者制作并开源了一个跨平台（支持Mac/Windows）的AI清理skill。该skill会扫描文件并生成可交互的HTML报告，通过三色分级（绿灯可放心清理、黄灯需人工判断、红灯禁止动）直观展示，并提供安全执行按钮。实测清理后释放了近120G空间，相比CleanMyMac仅扫描出的15.8G，其信息更透明、建议更详细。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpw5sd9k00agsl1un4z8njv7","originalUrl":"https://x.com/Khazix0918/status/2061669881725309048","publishedAt":"2026-06-03T00:00:18.182Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1vqp2uz","originalSourceName":"X：卡兹克 (@Khazix0918)","family":"outlet-xxwkks","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpw5sd9k00agsl1un4z8njv7","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T21:05:43.666Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1vqp2uz","name":"X：卡兹克 (@Khazix0918)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T21:05:43.666Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"作者受一条推文启发，使用Codex对自己的MacBook进行了只读存储分析，发现了B站缓存视频等大量可清理空间（激进方案超140G）。为替代收费软件CleanMyMac，作者制作并开源了一个跨平台（支持Mac/Windows）的AI清理skill。该skill会扫描文件并生成可交互的HTML报告，通过三色分级（绿灯可放心清理、黄灯需人工判断、红灯禁止动）直观展示，并提供安全执行按钮。实测清理后释放了近120G空间，相比CleanMyMac仅扫描出的15.8G，其信息更透明、建议更详细。","reportEdition":"2026-06-03","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpwrs3jx004wsl79yv419af3","title":"商汤开源SenseNova-Skills AI办公技能套件","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-06-03T00:00:18.182Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpwrs3jx004wsl79yv419af3","https://x.com/SenseTime_AI/status/2061822148076093625"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpwrs3jx004wsl79yv419af3","title":"商汤开源SenseNova-Skills AI办公技能套件","originalTitle":"","summary":"商汤开源了AI办公技能套件SenseNova-Skills。这是一个为任何技能兼容智能体（如OpenClaw与HermesAgent）设计的开源技能集合，提供四大核心功能：图像信息图表生成（可镜像参考风格）、数据分析（支持多表解析、清洗与可视化）、PPT创建（生成大纲内容并智能排版，输出可编辑文件）以及深度研究（跨学术、技术、社交等多源搜索并生成报告）。该技能套件现已完全开源。","reason":"","url":"