"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpwndkv504h2slsnenpm5ynd","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T21:05:43.666Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-182k5xk","name":"The Verge：订阅版科技（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T21:05:43.666Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"Google DeepMind的AI模型Gemini Spark提供了一次极为深刻但同时令人感到不安的用户体验。该模型展现的强大能力令人印象深刻，但其带来的影响和潜力也引发了深刻的恐惧感。","reportEdition":"2026-06-03","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpwv1omp0100sl79979r1mj7","title":"开放模型的繁荣生态","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-06-03T00:00:18.182Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpwv1omp0100sl79979r1mj7","https://www.tomtunguz.com/the-thriving-ecosystem-of-open-models"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpwv1omp0100sl79979r1mj7","title":"开放模型的繁荣生态","originalTitle":"","summary":"根据OpenRouter平台数据，自2025年以来，开放模型使用量显著增长。最新数据显示，开放权重模型产生了69.1%的token使用量，闭源模型为30.9%。新模型的发布会吸引开发者测试，推动token使用量达到新的平台期。开放模型市场内部竞争激烈，领导地位频繁更迭，如DeepSeek的早期优势在2025年末至2026年初被MiniMax与Kimi模型取代，随后MiMo、Qwen、腾讯Hy3、阿里巴巴及Arcee等模型的发布再次改变了份额格局。尽管开放模型目前仍只占推理总量的一小部分，但激烈的竞争与增长表明，开发者正越来越愿意将生产流量路由至开放模型。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpwv1omp0100sl79979r1mj7","originalUrl":"https://www.tomtunguz.com/the-thriving-ecosystem-of-open-models","publishedAt":"2026-06-03T00:00:18.182Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-uw5ga9","originalSourceName":"Tomasz Tunguz 博客（VC 分析）","family":"outlet-eygl44","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpwv1omp0100sl79979r1mj7","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T21:05:43.666Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-uw5ga9","name":"Tomasz Tunguz 博客（VC 分析）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T21:05:43.666Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"根据OpenRouter平台数据，自2025年以来，开放模型使用量显著增长。最新数据显示，开放权重模型产生了69.1%的token使用量，闭源模型为30.9%。新模型的发布会吸引开发者测试，推动token使用量达到新的平台期。开放模型市场内部竞争激烈，领导地位频繁更迭，如DeepSeek的早期优势在2025年末至2026年初被MiniMax与Kimi模型取代，随后MiMo、Qwen、腾讯Hy3、阿里巴巴及Arcee等模型的发布再次改变了份额格局。尽管开放模型目前仍只占推理总量的一小部分，但激烈的竞争与增长表明，开发者正越来越愿意将生产流量路由至开放模型。","reportEdition":"2026-06-03","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpwuirwl00tisl79gfmq5mmf","title":"Gary Marcus：为什么事情终将崩塌","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-06-03T00:00:18.182Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpwuirwl00tisl79gfmq5mmf","https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/why-things-will-eventually-fall-apart"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpwuirwl00tisl79gfmq5mmf","title":"Gary Marcus：为什么事情终将崩塌","originalTitle":"","summary":"知名人工智能批评者Gary Marcus在其关于可信赖AI的专栏中，探讨了人工智能发展面临的根本性挑战。文章开篇即指向问题的核心，指出相关数学理论的局限性与人类心理的复杂性，是导致AI系统最终可能出现问题的根源。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpwuirwl00tisl79gfmq5mmf","originalUrl":"https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/why-things-will-eventually-fall-apart","publishedAt":"2026-06-03T00:00:18.182Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1b4wzwz","originalSourceName":"Gary Marcus：The Road to AI We Can Trust（RSS）","family":"outlet-a0gkqk","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-